"1740\" alt=\"изображение\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e9ace03b-6690-44f5-8361-c937f5a3d059\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1844\" height=\"1619\" alt=\"изображение\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ef168e9-b953-480f-bbd1-809968ad1c5f\" />\r\n\r\nI mostly adapted a code from a https://github.com/cashew-olddew/godot-shader-previewer addon (and transformed it to C++).\r\n\r\nTest shader on screenshot:\r\n```gdshader\r\nshader_type canvas_item;\r\n\r\nuniform sampler2D tex;\r\n\r\nvoid fragment() {\r\n\tvec3 v = texture(tex, UV).rgb;\r\n\tvec2 v2 = vec2(sin(v.x), cos(v.y));\r\n\tvec3 v3 = vec3(0, 0.25, 0.5);\r\n\tvec2 v4 = UV;\r\n\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14373","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":2